; -- the host side of the XAPR plug-in's file-layer slots (the plug-in's header words +0x20..+0x54,
;    named in ../hdsx3/hdsx3_manual.sym / ../hdsx3/README.md "the header"; XaprCallDiskFreeSpace is +0x1C)
